                          ],
                          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"Eligible Category List\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"items\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"EligibleCategoryId\", \"EligibleCategoryName\", \"Description\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"EligibleCategoryId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"EligibleCategoryName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"Description\": {\n            \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
                          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
                        },
                        {
                          "metadata": {
                            "name": "Read Eligible Cats JS",
                            "returnType": "object",
                            "sourceCode": "const response = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_TRANSACTION.FOR_EACH_CREDIT.GET_ELIGIBLE_CATS_BO.$output; \n\nconst result = (response.items || []).map(r => ({\n  EligibleCategoryId: r.EligibleCategoryId ?? null,\n  EligibleCategoryName: r.EligibleCategoryName ?? null,\n  Description: r.Description ?? null\n}));\n\nreturn JSON.stringify(result);"
                          },
                          "outcomes": {
                            "success": "1773182941988"
                          },
                          "code": "READ_ELIGIBLE_CATS_JS",
                          "id": "1773182638655",
                          "inputs": [],
                          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
                          "type": "CODE"
                        },
                        {
                          "metadata": {
                            "modelConfiguration": {
                              "modelProperties": {
                                "k": 0,
                                "max_completion_tokens": 32000,
                                "reasoning_effort": "medium"
                              },
                              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
                              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM",
                              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
                              "modelName": "GPT-5 mini"
                            },
                            "name": "Match eligible categories LLM"
                          },
                          "outcomes": {
                            "success": "1773780020492"
                          },
                          "code": "MATCH_ELIGIBLE_CATEGORIES_LLM",
                          "id": "1773182941988",
                          "inputs": [
                            {
                              "id": "1773182941999_1",
                              "name": "prompt",
                              "type": "string",
                              "value": "You are an LLM matching agent for an Oracle Fusion Incentive Compensation estimation workflow.\n\nTask\nGiven (1) a credit object and (2) a list of eligible categories, set the credit’s EligibleCategoryId based on the user’s EligibleCategoryInfo.\n\nInputs\n\nCredit:\n{{$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_TRANSACTION.FOR_EACH_CREDIT.$currentItem}}\n\nEligible categories list (object with \"items\" array):\n{{$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_TRANSACTION.FOR_EACH_CREDIT.GET_ELIGIBLE_CATS_BO.$output}}\n\nOutput (STRICT)\n- Return ONLY the updated credit as valid JSON.\n- Do not wrap the output. Do not output any extra text or keys outside the credit object.\n\nData locations inside the credit\n- EligibleCategoryInfo is stored in credit.populatedFields where name == \"EligibleCategoryInfo\" (use its value as the user hint)\n- EligibleCategoryId must be stored in credit.populatedFields where name == \"EligibleCategoryId\" ONLY when you have selected a category\n\nGuardrails\n- Ensure credit.populatedFields exists as an array.\n- Ensure credit.errors exists as an array (create [] if missing).\n- If a populatedFields item with name == \"EligibleCategoryId\" already exists and has a non-empty value, do not change it. Return the credit as-is.\n\nHow to select EligibleCategoryId\n1) Read user hint\n- Let info be the value of the populatedFields item where name == \"EligibleCategoryInfo\" (if missing, treat as empty).\n\n2) Candidate list\n- Use the eligible categories list items (each has EligibleCategoryId, EligibleCategoryName, Description).\n\n3) If there are no eligible categories\n- Do not create an EligibleCategoryId populated field.\n- Add one error to credit.errors:\n  \"No eligible category was found. Available eligible categories: (none)\"\n- Return the credit.\n\n4) If there is exactly one eligible category available\n- Let onlyCat be the single item.\n- If info is empty, select onlyCat.\n- If info is present, select onlyCat only when info is reasonably consistent with onlyCat’s name/description (not considerably different). Otherwise do not select and follow the “cannot confidently select” rule below.\n\n5) Direct ID match\n- If info contains an ID that exactly matches a candidate EligibleCategoryId, select it.\n\n6) Semantic match (use LLM understanding)\n- Try to match info to exactly one category using EligibleCategoryName and Description.\n- Use meaning, not just exact text (abbreviations, singular/plural, minor typos, key-term overlap).\n- Select only when there is a single clear best match.\n\nOn successful selection\n- Ensure there is a populatedFields item where name == \"EligibleCategoryId\" (create it if missing).\n- Set:\n  - value = selected EligibleCategoryId\n  - userFriendlyValue = selected EligibleCategoryName\n  - errors = [] (if the populatedFields schema includes errors)\n- Remove field with name \"EligibleCategoryInfo\"\n- Do not add an error.\n- If credit.errors already contains a message similar to \"No eligible category was found.\", you may remove it.\n- Return the credit.\n\nWhen you cannot confidently select\n- Do not create an EligibleCategoryId populated field if it does not already exist.\n- If an EligibleCategoryId populated field exists but its value is empty/null, remove that populatedFields item.\n- Add one error message to credit.errors:\n  \"Which eligible category should I use for this?\nAvailable options: <comma-separated names>\"\n  - Names must be derived from EligibleCategoryName values in the list.\n- Return the credit.\n\nNow return the updated credit JSON."
                            }
                          ],
                          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"Credit\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": true,\n  \"required\": [\"populatedFields\", \"validated\", \"errors\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"populatedFields\": { \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/populatedFields\" },\n    \"validated\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" },\n    \"errors\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n    }\n  },\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"populatedFields\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"name\", \"value\", \"dbColumn\", \"validated\", \"required\", \"errors\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"value\": {},\n          \"userFriendlyValue\": {},\n          \"dbColumn\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"validated\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" },\n          \"required\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" },\n          \"errors\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n          },\n          \"isDFF\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
                          "type": "LLM"
                        },
